From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Mon, 15 Sep 2026 08:40:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sysbus: let the record pipeline reach camera2

media_recorder.cpp:810 queries the capture format with

  luna://com.webos.service.camera2/getFormat

but the "com.webos.pipeline.record.*" permissions entry - the name the
pipeline registers - has an empty outbound list, so ls-hubd refuses the name
query. com.webos.service.mediarecorder-* next door already lists camera2; the
pipeline itself was missed.

The pipeline already holds camera.operation, which covers getFormat, so the
outbound entry is the only thing missing.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
---
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 pipeline/files/sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.record.role.json.in | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/pipeline/files/sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.record.role.json.in
+++ b/pipeline/files/sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.record.role.json.in
@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@
         {
             "service":"com.webos.pipeline.record.*",
             "inbound" : ["com.webos.service.mediarecorder-*"],
-            "outbound": []
+            "outbound": ["com.webos.service.camera2"]
         },
         {
             "service":"com.webos.rm.client*",
